with a tftp image, which takes up a couple of M's, so the install just
used about 15M or 16M of memory, but with a swap partition of about 100M
it installed just fine :). (beware! the libperl ebuild wants a lot of ram
during compile, at least 40M+, on my first attempt the swap partition was
to small :)

